WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.100 --> 01:47.940
=Episode 6=

01:54.780 --> 01:57.020
(Stop that train now!)

01:57.020 --> 01:58.940
(Go! Cut it off!)

01:58.940 --> 02:01.420
(Alarm! Alarm!)

02:01.420 --> 02:03.140
(Suri, Gis! Get in here!)

02:03.820 --> 02:07.020
("Walter Defends Sarajevo")
(Yugoslavia)

02:15.426 --> 02:15.980
Fang Muyang.

02:16.360 --> 02:17.180
Let's switch seats.

02:17.590 --> 02:18.080
No.

02:19.150 --> 02:20.271
I can see better from here.

02:20.720 --> 02:21.190
Come on.

02:21.640 --> 02:23.020
It looks the same from anywhere.

02:23.940 --> 02:24.940
Then why switch?

02:26.560 --> 02:27.410
I just want this seat.

02:27.460 --> 02:28.930
What's your deal sitting here?

02:29.200 --> 02:29.690
Come on.

02:29.940 --> 02:30.730
Let's trade seats.

02:31.140 --> 02:31.960
Stop pulling me.

02:32.630 --> 02:33.940
I want to sit next to Fei Ni.

02:34.090 --> 02:34.910
Why sit here?

02:35.020 --> 02:36.160
Don't block the view.

02:36.160 --> 02:38.426
I'm not blocking anyone.
I just want to sit with Fei Ni.

02:42.115 --> 02:43.120
I'll switch with you.

02:50.740 --> 02:52.460
(Drive straight to Višegrad.)

02:52.860 --> 02:53.700
(Why not?)

02:54.060 --> 02:55.500
(It's been a long time.)

02:56.260 --> 02:57.660
(Can you blow it without dynamite?)

02:59.260 --> 03:00.740
(Only the living get to see it.)

03:06.650 --> 03:07.460
This is good.

03:07.460 --> 03:08.500
The fight's about to start.

03:08.500 --> 03:09.860
(Gis, maintain speed.)

03:09.940 --> 03:10.530
Here it comes.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.020
Fang Muyang.

03:54.900 --> 03:58.180
(Jiangcheng Worker-Peasant Hospital)

03:58.460 --> 03:59.410
You should head up.

04:00.300 --> 04:01.140
Let me walk you home.

04:01.810 --> 04:02.620
No need.

04:02.720 --> 04:03.440
If you do,

04:03.440 --> 04:04.620
we'll have to walk you back.

04:04.620 --> 04:06.180
By the time we're done, it'll be dark.

04:08.860 --> 04:09.500
See you.

04:24.210 --> 04:25.060
Ye Feng.

04:25.590 --> 04:26.630
Today was unexpected.

04:26.900 --> 04:28.220
I had no idea he'd show up.

04:28.840 --> 04:30.530
I'll pay you back for the ticket.

04:31.060 --> 04:31.910
No need.

04:32.300 --> 04:33.870
I can afford a movie ticket

04:33.870 --> 04:35.400
for a hero who saved someone's life.

04:36.940 --> 04:37.810
But Fei Ni...

04:38.590 --> 04:39.560
Don't you think

04:39.810 --> 04:41.520
Fang Muyang might have feelings for you?

04:42.260 --> 04:43.120
Absolutely not.

04:43.360 --> 04:44.720
He lost his memory.

04:44.810 --> 04:46.030
He forgot a lot of things,

04:46.300 --> 04:48.850
even basic life skills.

04:49.060 --> 04:51.280
I've been taking care of him lately.

04:51.450 --> 04:53.520
That's why he keeps coming to me.

04:53.980 --> 04:55.370
Once his memory comes back,

04:55.370 --> 04:56.290
it won't be like this.

04:57.660 --> 04:59.230
I get that.

04:59.370 --> 05:01.320
But he's still a grown man.

05:01.620 --> 05:03.210
He's running to you for everything

05:03.210 --> 05:03.550
and...

05:04.060 --> 05:05.690
He doesn't seem to know boundaries.

05:05.690 --> 05:06.640
That's not good for you

05:06.640 --> 05:07.730
or for us.

05:08.240 --> 05:08.860
So,

05:08.860 --> 05:11.110
I think you two should
stop seeing each other.

05:13.360 --> 05:15.160
You have a point.

05:15.640 --> 05:16.760
But actually,

05:17.130 --> 05:19.350
the factory assigned me
to look after him.

05:19.610 --> 05:21.710
And I promised Ms. Xu I would...

05:21.710 --> 05:22.420
No.

05:24.760 --> 05:26.100
If we're together,

05:26.226 --> 05:27.740
we have to be mindful of boundaries.

05:27.860 --> 05:29.250
As for my mom, don't worry.

05:29.250 --> 05:30.030
I'll talk to her.

05:32.690 --> 05:33.550
Then, it's settled.

05:34.610 --> 05:36.890
There was actually something else
I wanted to tell you.

05:37.080 --> 05:38.480
Fang Muyang interrupted earlier,

05:38.480 --> 05:39.420
and I almost forgot.

05:39.810 --> 05:40.560
Go on.

05:41.570 --> 05:43.770
My mom mentioned something a while back.

05:44.130 --> 05:45.230
For the past few years,

05:45.230 --> 05:47.310
you've been trying
really hard to get into college.

05:48.060 --> 05:49.510
I haven't given up.

05:50.690 --> 05:51.890
Here's how I see it.

05:52.093 --> 05:53.170
You want to go to college,

05:53.270 --> 05:55.460
so you can
land a good job after graduation,

05:55.460 --> 05:56.480
and find a good husband.

05:56.670 --> 05:57.850
But now you're with me.

05:58.180 --> 05:59.700
Whether it's you or your brother,

05:59.700 --> 06:01.010
my mom can help

06:01.010 --> 06:02.130
you both find good jobs.

06:02.420 --> 06:03.800
So about college,

06:04.060 --> 06:05.920
if we get married,
maybe you could let that go?

06:08.180 --> 06:09.400
Think about it.

06:09.690 --> 06:11.330
If you do go to college,

06:11.330 --> 06:12.830
we'd just get married and you'd leave.

06:13.280 --> 06:15.515
What would be the point of that?

06:16.160 --> 06:16.890
Besides,

06:17.060 --> 06:18.500
my mom would definitely want

06:18.500 --> 06:20.080
her daughter-in-law at home.

06:20.350 --> 06:21.990
She'd love to have a grandchild.

06:26.330 --> 06:26.920
Fei Ni.

06:27.782 --> 06:28.826
What do you think?

06:31.060 --> 06:32.420
We can talk about the future later.

06:33.950 --> 06:35.210
As for our relationship,

06:35.580 --> 06:37.090
Ms. Xu doesn't know yet, right?

06:37.660 --> 06:38.940
How does she feel?

06:39.048 --> 06:39.893
How about this?

06:40.130 --> 06:41.500
Come over for dinner sometime.

06:41.860 --> 06:43.130
Don't worry about her.

06:43.130 --> 06:44.600
She'll like you.

06:45.080 --> 06:47.260
And if you don't want to
stay in the workshop,

06:47.680 --> 06:48.640
I'll ask my mom

06:48.640 --> 06:49.915
to transfer you to the office.

06:49.937 --> 06:50.880
But about college,

06:50.880 --> 06:52.010
do we have a deal?

06:53.500 --> 06:53.920
I...

06:54.450 --> 06:55.810
I'll think about it.

06:56.540 --> 06:56.900
Alright.

06:57.280 --> 06:57.980
Let's head home.

06:58.500 --> 06:59.440
No need to walk me.

06:59.804 --> 07:01.010
It's not even on your way.

07:01.010 --> 07:02.060
All this back and forth...

07:02.060 --> 07:03.060
Okay, I get it.

07:03.330 --> 07:04.330
I'll go then.

07:04.382 --> 07:05.515
See you at the factory.

07:05.570 --> 07:06.000
Okay.

07:10.130 --> 07:10.590
Bye.

07:27.690 --> 07:28.810
(He wouldn't come back)

07:28.960 --> 07:30.980
(because he was afraid
you'd have nowhere to live.)

07:31.410 --> 07:32.210
(I promise,)

07:32.210 --> 07:34.390
(within three months,
my brother will marry you.)

07:34.500 --> 07:36.620
(I'm just worried that chasing college)

07:36.620 --> 07:37.980
(and taking care of that "hero")

07:38.100 --> 07:40.060
(will cost you your future.)

07:41.293 --> 07:43.620
(If we're together,
we have to be mindful of boundaries.)

07:43.620 --> 07:45.900
(You two should stop seeing each other.)

07:46.080 --> 07:47.540
(Whether it's you or your brother,)

07:47.540 --> 07:48.850
(my mom can help)

07:48.860 --> 07:50.010
(you both find good jobs.)

07:50.060 --> 07:51.500
So about college,

07:51.660 --> 07:53.600
if we get married,
maybe you could let that go?

08:03.100 --> 08:04.690
(Jiangnan University,
Teaching Building No. 1)

08:04.690 --> 08:05.500
Fang,

08:06.060 --> 08:07.690
this research project is highly valued

08:08.350 --> 08:09.700
by the leadership.

08:10.500 --> 08:12.330
It's highly confidential.

08:13.200 --> 08:14.940
After careful consideration,

08:15.300 --> 08:16.330
the committee feels

08:16.770 --> 08:17.790
you're not the right fit.

08:20.270 --> 08:22.230
But don't lose heart.

08:22.690 --> 08:24.370
(You did a lot of groundwork.)

08:24.370 --> 08:25.730
(It won't go to waste.)

08:26.300 --> 08:29.430
(Summarize your preliminary results)

08:29.660 --> 08:32.490
(and hand them over to Ding Yang
from your dorm.)

08:39.610 --> 08:40.310
Excuse me,

08:40.493 --> 08:41.970
how do I get to the Math Department?

08:42.880 --> 08:43.950
Go inside and turn right.

08:44.400 --> 08:45.120
It's you.

08:48.900 --> 08:49.690
Do you remember me?

08:54.060 --> 08:54.900
I don't.

09:08.210 --> 09:10.900
Private rooms have been crowded lately,

09:11.090 --> 09:12.380
so Fang Muyang

09:12.570 --> 09:13.680
was assigned here.

09:30.640 --> 09:31.530
Here, take a look.

09:32.660 --> 09:33.810
That's really well done.

09:34.060 --> 09:34.860
Thank you.

09:36.680 --> 09:37.360
Fei Ni's here.

09:37.580 --> 09:38.160
Fei Ni.

09:38.426 --> 09:39.730
- Fang Muyang.
- You're here.

09:39.730 --> 09:41.300
You made me look too old.

09:41.537 --> 09:42.180
How is that old?

09:42.180 --> 09:42.780
Fix it.

09:42.780 --> 09:43.915
There's not even a wrinkle.

09:43.990 --> 09:45.140
I'll redraw it another day.

09:47.310 --> 09:47.910
You're here.

09:50.020 --> 09:50.380
Yeah.

10:03.850 --> 10:04.660
I've got it.

10:04.850 --> 10:05.340
I'll do it.

10:07.715 --> 10:08.540
I'll make the bed.

10:08.850 --> 10:09.730
Leave it to me.

10:09.780 --> 10:10.537
I'll handle it.

10:10.730 --> 10:12.660
Tuck this side in like so.

10:14.800 --> 10:15.690
Fang Muyang.

10:16.660 --> 10:18.470
See? Nice and neat.

10:24.610 --> 10:25.250
What's wrong?

10:32.640 --> 10:33.370
Nothing.

10:34.440 --> 10:36.330
I took the day off.

10:37.020 --> 10:38.410
I can take you out.

10:39.150 --> 10:40.060
All day?

10:45.180 --> 10:46.300
Let's go see a movie.

10:47.020 --> 10:47.540
Okay.

10:48.260 --> 10:49.200
After the movie,

10:49.200 --> 10:49.850
we'll get you

10:50.260 --> 10:51.440
some new clothes.

10:53.180 --> 10:53.570
Let's go.

11:00.940 --> 11:02.570
How many times have I told you?

11:02.730 --> 11:04.780
Put the paint back when you're done.

11:05.090 --> 11:06.400
Otherwise, it gets everywhere.

11:11.780 --> 11:12.450
Got it?

11:12.780 --> 11:13.210
Yeah.

11:15.740 --> 11:18.420
("Waves of the Danube")
(Romania)

11:23.690 --> 11:26.000
You must've seen this before.

11:26.660 --> 11:27.610
Does it ring a bell?

11:35.070 --> 11:36.330
Try to remember.

11:47.540 --> 11:49.460
(I thought I'd give it one last try.)

11:49.790 --> 11:51.820
(Maybe something would come back.)

11:53.940 --> 11:55.360
(Guess there's no hope.)

11:56.260 --> 11:56.900
(Forget it.)

11:57.320 --> 11:58.930
(Let this be a final goodbye.)

12:08.020 --> 12:11.140
(Hongxing Supply
and Marketing Cooperative)

12:11.140 --> 12:12.160
Let me see this one.

12:12.400 --> 12:12.960
That piece.

12:13.210 --> 12:13.680
Sure.

12:14.540 --> 12:15.040
Look.

12:16.880 --> 12:17.810
It just came in.

12:17.930 --> 12:18.950
How much is it?

12:18.950 --> 12:19.590
Twenty yuan.

12:19.730 --> 12:20.570
Twenty?

12:21.510 --> 12:22.060
Excuse me,

12:22.490 --> 12:24.420
could you get that dress down for me?

12:24.940 --> 12:26.020
Sure. The green one?

12:26.020 --> 12:26.330
Yes.

12:26.330 --> 12:26.900
Alright.

12:27.610 --> 12:28.610
That's for girls.

12:28.610 --> 12:29.330
Nice and pretty.

12:29.330 --> 12:30.460
Boys don't wear dresses.

12:30.460 --> 12:31.020
Put it back.

12:31.020 --> 12:32.140
I'm not wearing it.

12:32.330 --> 12:33.380
It's for you.

12:34.900 --> 12:36.450
I'm not wearing it.

12:36.540 --> 12:38.730
I don't like dresses. Put it back.

12:39.700 --> 12:41.226
Well, I don't like sweaters, either.

12:42.690 --> 12:44.940
You'll freeze in winter without one.

12:45.220 --> 12:46.350
It's not winter yet.

12:47.510 --> 12:48.170
Trust me.

12:48.360 --> 12:49.440
We're getting the sweater.

12:49.440 --> 12:50.070
This one.

12:50.850 --> 12:52.210
My sister gave me the money.

12:52.380 --> 12:53.180
Trust me.

12:53.490 --> 12:54.260
Get the dress.

12:55.090 --> 12:55.810
The sweater.

12:56.050 --> 12:57.970
So which one is it?

12:58.300 --> 12:59.060
The sweater.

12:59.060 --> 12:59.670
Wrap this up.

12:59.670 --> 13:00.770
Are you sure?

13:00.770 --> 13:01.330
Sure.

13:01.570 --> 13:03.090
Pure wool, you know.

13:03.360 --> 13:03.940
Thanks.

13:06.340 --> 13:07.540
(Long Live the Great Unity)

13:07.540 --> 13:09.530
Haven't you always wanted ice cream?

13:10.240 --> 13:11.250
My treat today.

13:11.420 --> 13:11.970
Okay.

13:12.590 --> 13:13.610
No need for the menu.

13:13.610 --> 13:15.130
Two fried pork cutlets,

13:15.130 --> 13:15.970
two borscht...

13:15.970 --> 13:17.204
- That's enough.
- And two...

13:17.660 --> 13:18.850
And one ice cream.

13:19.210 --> 13:19.730
Thanks.

13:19.730 --> 13:20.330
Just a moment.

13:22.380 --> 13:23.830
The pork cutlets here are great.

13:24.030 --> 13:24.940
And the borscht, too.

13:25.048 --> 13:26.280
I want you to try everything.

13:26.700 --> 13:27.530
You'll love it.

13:28.560 --> 13:30.060
Did something come back to you?

13:30.850 --> 13:31.610
No.

13:32.370 --> 13:33.610
They're just like the ice cream,

13:34.330 --> 13:35.010
all right here.

13:40.690 --> 13:41.230
Here it comes.

13:44.810 --> 13:45.490
Thank you.

13:49.660 --> 13:50.380
Go on, try it.

14:11.810 --> 14:12.610
Fang Muyang.

14:19.610 --> 14:21.410
If you get your memory back,

14:23.570 --> 14:25.700
then my job will be done.

14:27.310 --> 14:28.970
Even if I don't get to go to college,

14:29.937 --> 14:31.826
at least, I won't
owe your sister anything.

14:32.520 --> 14:33.450
We'll be square.

14:34.230 --> 14:35.040
No debts between us.

14:58.000 --> 14:59.090
Your fried pork cutlets.

15:03.140 --> 15:03.670
Thank you.

15:14.020 --> 15:14.650
By the way,

15:15.200 --> 15:16.890
you're almost fully recovered now.

15:17.248 --> 15:18.871
You can't stay in the hospital forever.

15:19.020 --> 15:20.600
You'll get sick just being here.

15:20.760 --> 15:22.226
Go to the Educated Youth Office.

15:22.450 --> 15:23.850
Ask them for housing.

15:24.090 --> 15:26.000
You're a hero,
and they won't ignore you.

15:26.330 --> 15:26.980
Okay?

15:28.180 --> 15:28.900
Okay.

16:15.330 --> 16:16.140
Fang Muyang.

16:17.280 --> 16:18.050
Remember this.

16:18.610 --> 16:19.890
You saved four people

16:19.890 --> 16:21.140
in a torrential storm.

16:21.226 --> 16:23.210
The Educated Youth Office
and the Textile Factory

16:23.210 --> 16:24.740
are obligated to take care of you.

16:25.140 --> 16:26.810
Whatever difficulties you run into,

16:27.260 --> 16:29.440
anything you need, you can ask them.

16:30.490 --> 16:31.610
Personal matters

16:31.610 --> 16:32.740
and work matters too.

16:33.600 --> 16:35.510
And as long as you're in the hospital,

16:35.730 --> 16:37.970
they owe you a bottle of milk every day.

16:38.140 --> 16:39.180
If the nurse forgets,

16:39.180 --> 16:40.450
ask the head nurse for it.

16:49.810 --> 16:51.200
All your money's in here.

16:51.690 --> 16:53.200
Including what I owed you before.

16:53.370 --> 16:54.210
It's all inside.

16:54.800 --> 16:55.440
From now on,

16:55.800 --> 16:57.500
whether it's food or clothes,

16:58.160 --> 16:59.020
you need to budget.

16:59.150 --> 16:59.940
I taught you how.

17:00.690 --> 17:01.840
At the rate you spend,

17:02.540 --> 17:03.580
you won't last a month.

17:04.420 --> 17:05.130
Got it?

17:06.370 --> 17:07.630
You said a lot today.

17:07.760 --> 17:08.740
I didn't catch it all.

17:10.160 --> 17:11.270
Tell me again tomorrow.

17:15.820 --> 17:16.960
I'm not coming tomorrow.

17:16.960 --> 17:17.950
What about the day after?

17:17.950 --> 17:18.680
Not then either.

17:20.010 --> 17:21.190
Or the day after that.

17:22.930 --> 17:23.830
I'm not coming anymore.

17:25.890 --> 17:26.370
Fei Ni...

17:28.900 --> 17:29.900
Is it because

17:29.900 --> 17:30.910
I spent too much today?

17:31.420 --> 17:32.490
If that's why,

17:32.940 --> 17:34.290
I'll do it your way from now on.

17:34.730 --> 17:35.640
I'll be frugal.

17:38.490 --> 17:40.050
Look, I can wash my own clothes now.

17:40.730 --> 17:41.860
I sewed my buttons back on.

17:44.730 --> 17:46.110
I just can't quite tie my laces.

17:54.804 --> 17:56.950
Fine. I'll show you one more time.
Watch closely.

18:01.180 --> 18:02.010
Cross them.

18:02.690 --> 18:03.380
Loop it around.

18:03.770 --> 18:04.630
Pull it through.

18:04.860 --> 18:05.660
Tighten it.

18:05.940 --> 18:06.470
Pull snug.

18:15.671 --> 18:17.270
Is that how I taught you, Fang Muyang?

18:22.780 --> 18:23.470
It's too hard.

18:24.450 --> 18:25.550
Teach me again tomorrow.

18:26.420 --> 18:27.980
Are you doing this on purpose?

18:29.620 --> 18:30.170
Fei Ni.

18:31.080 --> 18:31.970
Don't be mad.

18:32.290 --> 18:34.010
Please don't be mad.

18:35.490 --> 18:35.900
I...

18:36.050 --> 18:37.920
I'll learn tomorrow. I promise.

18:38.490 --> 18:39.690
Just come teach me again.

18:41.382 --> 18:42.880
I don't even want the money.

18:43.010 --> 18:43.980
You keep it.

18:44.250 --> 18:46.260
How long are you going to cling to me?

18:46.730 --> 18:48.860
I'm not obligated
to tend to you every day!

18:51.290 --> 18:52.240
I've taken care of you,

18:52.240 --> 18:53.660
and you still can't tie your shoes.

18:53.820 --> 18:55.420
How long are you going to hold me back?

18:56.690 --> 18:57.250
Yes.

18:57.660 --> 18:58.450
I admit it.

18:59.830 --> 19:01.280
At the beginning, I used you.

19:03.140 --> 19:05.270
But I've taken care of you
all this time.

19:05.730 --> 19:07.250
I did my best.

19:08.140 --> 19:09.900
I never took a cent from you.

19:10.004 --> 19:11.380
I didn't get into college either.

19:11.730 --> 19:12.890
So we're even.

19:13.580 --> 19:14.600
I owe you an apology.

19:14.600 --> 19:15.270
I'm sorry.

19:15.293 --> 19:17.115
I shouldn't have dragged you into lying.

19:17.380 --> 19:18.940
I shouldn't have overestimated myself

19:18.940 --> 19:21.182
and promised your sister
I'd see you through recovery.

19:21.900 --> 19:23.300
This is all on me.

19:28.420 --> 19:29.030
Fang Muyang.

19:31.210 --> 19:33.220
Right now,
I just want to focus on my own life.

19:34.940 --> 19:36.000
I'm disappointed in myself.

19:38.182 --> 19:39.920
I don't want
to disappoint my family too.

19:41.626 --> 19:43.271
Let's not see each other anymore.

19:54.820 --> 19:55.450
Fei Ni!

20:32.580 --> 20:34.900
(Fang Mujing, 100 yuan)

21:33.530 --> 21:34.210
(Fang Muyang!)

21:34.210 --> 21:34.970
(Bad news!)

21:34.970 --> 21:35.950
(Trouble at your house!)

21:38.970 --> 21:39.730
(Yangyang,)

21:39.940 --> 21:42.860
(don't blame your parents
for not taking care of you.)

21:42.860 --> 21:45.820
(They had no choice.)

21:46.380 --> 21:50.690
(Grandma can't stay with you anymore.)

21:55.150 --> 21:56.480
(Grandma...)

21:58.270 --> 21:59.000
(Fang Muyang.)

21:59.130 --> 22:00.860
(You're no longer allowed to live here.)

22:00.900 --> 22:01.730
(You leave tomorrow)

22:01.730 --> 22:02.760
(for the countryside.)

22:15.450 --> 22:16.530
(I'm leaving tomorrow.)

22:16.530 --> 22:18.180
(We agreed
you'd hold onto this for now.)

22:18.180 --> 22:18.970
(Treat it as a loan.)

22:18.970 --> 22:19.510
(Forget it.)

22:19.770 --> 22:22.290
(I'm not expecting you
to ever pay me back.)

22:22.290 --> 22:22.860
(Fei Ni!)

22:24.490 --> 22:25.270
Wait for me.

22:30.490 --> 22:31.360
I promise

22:31.690 --> 22:33.010
I'll pay you back double.

22:36.137 --> 22:37.026
Alright.

22:37.180 --> 22:38.160
I'll hold you to it.

23:24.240 --> 23:24.850
Come down.

23:25.450 --> 23:25.970
Come down.

23:34.660 --> 23:35.290
Fei Ni.

23:38.730 --> 23:39.790
Why are you here again?

23:40.160 --> 23:41.010
I told you

23:41.010 --> 23:42.400
to stop seeing me.

23:43.600 --> 23:44.160
Why?

23:46.210 --> 23:46.860
Because

23:48.404 --> 23:49.440
I have to set boundaries.

23:51.040 --> 23:52.290
Are you marrying Ye Feng?

23:54.530 --> 23:55.260
Maybe.

23:56.690 --> 23:57.750
But don't worry.

23:58.660 --> 24:00.530
Even if I'm married
and can't look after you,

24:00.900 --> 24:02.180
the factory will assign someone.

24:03.800 --> 24:04.640
Do you like him?

24:07.940 --> 24:09.270
I wouldn't say I like him.

24:10.160 --> 24:11.450
But I don't dislike him either.

24:12.240 --> 24:14.080
He's a sensible choice for marriage.

24:14.970 --> 24:16.200
Steady job. A place to live.

24:19.580 --> 24:20.190
Anyway...

24:23.110 --> 24:23.510
Anyway,

24:23.510 --> 24:25.820
a lot of people don't marry for love.

24:26.410 --> 24:28.250
Then why marry someone you don't love?

24:29.930 --> 24:31.210
I have my reasons.

24:31.210 --> 24:32.560
My own difficulties.

24:38.970 --> 24:41.010
Only if I get married and move out

24:41.937 --> 24:43.900
can my brother come back
and get married.

24:48.010 --> 24:49.330
I owe him too much.

24:56.900 --> 24:57.710
Why did you come?

25:00.450 --> 25:01.060
Fei Ni.

25:03.670 --> 25:04.740
If I get better,

25:06.100 --> 25:07.260
will you still come see me?

25:08.560 --> 25:10.280
If you get your memory back,

25:12.480 --> 25:14.550
then my job will be done.

25:15.420 --> 25:17.100
Even if I don't get to go to college,

25:17.204 --> 25:19.160
at least, I won't
owe your sister anything.

25:19.970 --> 25:21.050
We'll be square.

25:21.840 --> 25:22.660
No debts between us.

25:23.530 --> 25:24.290
Fang Muyang.

25:25.690 --> 25:26.560
Fang Muyang!

25:27.290 --> 25:27.970
Fei Ni.

25:28.480 --> 25:29.160
Don't rush.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.250
Once I have a job and a home,

25:32.320 --> 25:33.200
I'll come find you.

25:34.780 --> 25:35.480
Before that,

25:36.850 --> 25:38.160
don't marry anyone.

25:54.540 --> 25:59.100
(Jiangnan University,
Teaching Building No. 1)

26:05.826 --> 26:06.770
What a coincidence.

26:09.540 --> 26:10.230
We meet again.

26:15.580 --> 26:16.580
Can I ask you something?

26:19.030 --> 26:20.240
You teach math, right?

26:21.140 --> 26:22.280
What are the odds

26:22.530 --> 26:24.630
that two strangers run
into each other three times?

26:25.010 --> 26:26.690
Less than 1.5 in ten million.

26:30.530 --> 26:32.250
Do you know
how I got that number?

26:34.490 --> 26:35.410
I'm listening.

26:35.620 --> 26:36.330
I made it up.

26:38.760 --> 26:40.740
Because your premise is flawed.

26:43.800 --> 26:46.560
Is this really a coincidence?

26:47.360 --> 26:49.630
You saw my work ID on the train,
didn't you?

26:50.240 --> 26:52.110
You knew I teach here,

26:52.471 --> 26:54.160
and that I'm
in the Math Department.

26:55.180 --> 26:56.680
We met at the building entrance,

26:56.680 --> 26:58.980
and here.
Are these really coincidences?

27:00.260 --> 27:01.580
What exactly are you after?

27:05.900 --> 27:06.960
I'm not after anything.

27:07.240 --> 27:08.900
And let me say this again.

27:09.750 --> 27:11.690
On the train, when your bag spilled,

27:11.840 --> 27:12.920
it was an accident.

27:13.160 --> 27:14.760
I don't go through people's things.

27:14.760 --> 27:16.390
I have basic manners.

27:16.890 --> 27:18.180
Then why are you here?

27:18.290 --> 27:19.320
Dr. Qu!

27:21.420 --> 27:22.050
Professor Wu.

27:22.426 --> 27:23.770
Sorry to keep you waiting. Come.

27:23.860 --> 27:24.693
Have a seat inside.

27:29.580 --> 27:30.330
Get some water.

27:30.530 --> 27:31.980
Just a moment.

27:32.290 --> 27:32.980
Use this.

27:33.290 --> 27:35.720
I brought this tea back
from Beijing last time.

27:35.720 --> 27:36.180
Alright.

27:37.910 --> 27:38.540
So,

27:39.210 --> 27:40.230
how are your parents?

27:40.560 --> 27:41.110
They're well.

27:43.620 --> 27:49.380
(Jiangcheng Daily)

27:59.220 --> 28:04.130
(Editor-in-Chief's Office)

28:04.130 --> 28:05.182
Adjust the layout here.

28:05.600 --> 28:06.700
Tweak these sections again.

28:07.420 --> 28:08.080
Ting.

28:08.660 --> 28:09.340
Come here.

28:11.580 --> 28:12.900
These reader letters

28:12.900 --> 28:13.940
are very representative.

28:14.650 --> 28:16.190
Compile them later.

28:16.530 --> 28:18.350
We'll write back to these readers,

28:18.560 --> 28:20.180
and thank them for their suggestions.

28:20.300 --> 28:20.940
Got it.

28:23.530 --> 28:24.110
Excuse me.

28:25.770 --> 28:26.320
Hello.

28:26.537 --> 28:27.600
Who are you looking for?

28:27.600 --> 28:28.720
The person in charge.

28:28.980 --> 28:31.140
(Editor Liao)

28:31.140 --> 28:31.950
What's this about?

28:32.290 --> 28:33.820
I've done a few drawings.

28:33.940 --> 28:35.137
I'd like him to take a look.

28:35.204 --> 28:37.100
We only accept submissions by mail.

28:37.270 --> 28:39.300
President Fu doesn't
have time for walk-ins.

28:40.004 --> 28:41.826
If the vice president's busy,
[*"Fu" sounds like "vice"]

28:42.130 --> 28:43.250
the president will do.

28:45.240 --> 28:46.730
Are you here to cause trouble?

28:47.210 --> 28:47.930
Leave. Now.

28:47.970 --> 28:49.230
Or I'll have you escorted out.

28:49.230 --> 28:49.920
I'm not leaving.

28:50.380 --> 28:51.530
I'll wait for your president.

28:54.420 --> 28:56.590
Are you sick or something?

28:56.820 --> 28:58.240
Actually, yes.

28:58.660 --> 28:59.950
I'm still hospitalized.

29:02.560 --> 29:03.360
Get out.

29:06.530 --> 29:07.380
Out!

29:07.380 --> 29:07.970
Move!

29:08.200 --> 29:10.190
Leave now!

29:10.250 --> 29:11.220
What's all the noise?

29:12.420 --> 29:13.960
I could hear it from the corridor.

29:14.880 --> 29:15.450
President Fu.

29:15.450 --> 29:16.270
Perfect timing.

29:16.420 --> 29:18.060
He insists on seeing you.

29:18.860 --> 29:20.540
(Fu Boquan)

29:21.820 --> 29:22.860
Yang?

29:23.340 --> 29:24.050
Uncle Fu.

29:25.860 --> 29:27.180
What are you doing here?

29:27.340 --> 29:27.830
Come.

29:28.093 --> 29:28.960
Let's talk inside.

29:30.100 --> 29:30.620
Make tea.

29:35.940 --> 29:37.920
Why is he calling him "uncle"?

29:41.860 --> 29:42.620
Ms. Ding.

29:43.490 --> 29:45.860
Who was that man
looking for Professor Wu today?

29:46.340 --> 29:47.140
(Ding Yang)

29:47.140 --> 29:48.290
Dr. Qu Hua.

29:48.680 --> 29:50.780
He's a neurosurgeon
at the People's Hospital.

29:51.490 --> 29:53.100
Very humble and approachable.

29:53.210 --> 29:54.710
He's unlike the other privileged men.

29:56.180 --> 29:57.360
He is?

29:58.620 --> 29:59.690
Professor Wu mentioned it.

30:00.620 --> 30:01.590
I heard

30:01.820 --> 30:03.620
his father's a senior military officer,

30:03.620 --> 30:04.720
and his mother serves, too.

30:05.210 --> 30:07.190
He comes from a top cadre family.

30:08.940 --> 30:10.380
Then how does he know Professor Wu?

30:11.290 --> 30:12.430
They go way back.

30:12.690 --> 30:14.450
Professor Wu didn't elaborate.

30:15.820 --> 30:16.850
But this time,

30:16.850 --> 30:18.130
I think their hospital

30:18.130 --> 30:19.480
wants to build a statistics system.

30:19.770 --> 30:20.990
They need Professor Wu's help.

30:22.130 --> 30:23.610
They're talking in the admin office.

30:27.050 --> 30:28.850
I saw you two talking earlier.

30:29.140 --> 30:30.110
You don't know him?

30:31.820 --> 30:32.760
Not really.

30:33.330 --> 30:35.120
We just ran
into each other on a train once.

30:35.620 --> 30:36.680
That's odd.

30:37.120 --> 30:39.250
He mentioned you to Professor Wu.

30:39.250 --> 30:40.900
It sounded like you were close.

30:41.940 --> 30:42.930
What did he say?

30:43.530 --> 30:44.550
Nothing much.

30:44.970 --> 30:47.130
Just that you'd met a few times.

30:48.490 --> 30:49.730
And that you're good at math.

30:56.690 --> 30:57.400
Ms. Ding,

30:58.270 --> 30:59.310
I forgot something.

30:59.310 --> 31:00.471
You head back to the dorm.

31:00.471 --> 31:00.940
Alright.

31:01.210 --> 31:01.820
See you.

31:19.380 --> 31:20.400
It's obvious

31:21.700 --> 31:23.630
that your fundamentals are solid.

31:24.460 --> 31:26.010
You've built a strong foundation.

31:26.130 --> 31:28.180
Whether it's line work or color,

31:28.340 --> 31:30.000
you have your own perspective.

31:30.600 --> 31:32.730
You've had talent
since you were a child.

31:32.880 --> 31:34.660
Your father never admitted it.

31:35.490 --> 31:38.450
I once made a bet with him

31:38.830 --> 31:40.450
that one day, your achievements

31:40.450 --> 31:41.320
would rival his.

31:42.280 --> 31:43.180
But now...

31:49.010 --> 31:50.560
I haven't seen my dad in a long time.

31:51.690 --> 31:53.180
His last letter was six months ago.

31:58.860 --> 32:00.320
When you were unconscious,

32:00.490 --> 32:01.870
I visited you at the hospital.

32:02.390 --> 32:04.210
After that, work just got too busy.

32:06.900 --> 32:07.730
Uncle Fu,

32:09.690 --> 32:11.770
if you feel you owe me anything,

32:12.500 --> 32:14.520
then let me work here
full-time as an illustrator.

32:23.230 --> 32:24.640
You haven't changed a bit.

32:25.010 --> 32:27.420
If your father heard that,
he'd skin you alive.

32:27.590 --> 32:28.290
But...

32:29.100 --> 32:30.420
I do appreciate

32:30.620 --> 32:32.670
your straightforwardness.

32:34.720 --> 32:35.840
That said,

32:35.940 --> 32:38.490
we have our rules.

32:39.430 --> 32:40.970
Even as president,

32:40.970 --> 32:42.370
I can't bend them.

32:42.370 --> 32:43.140
You understand?

32:43.870 --> 32:44.380
I do.

32:49.140 --> 32:50.140
How about this?

32:51.450 --> 32:53.360
The newspaper and the magazine

32:53.420 --> 32:55.560
are jointly running a training program.

32:55.970 --> 32:58.340
You enroll in that.

32:58.340 --> 32:59.100
After you finish,

32:59.500 --> 33:02.050
you can draw serial comics
for the magazine.

33:02.320 --> 33:03.900
It won't be a formal staff position,

33:04.450 --> 33:06.670
but the stipend

33:07.490 --> 33:08.870
is quite decent.

33:09.900 --> 33:11.060
How long is the program?

33:11.460 --> 33:12.650
About two months.

33:14.210 --> 33:14.900
What is it?

33:15.190 --> 33:16.630
Are you short on money?

33:16.737 --> 33:17.893
How much do you need?

33:17.915 --> 33:18.510
I'll cover it.

33:18.620 --> 33:19.210
Uncle Fu,

33:19.580 --> 33:20.630
it's not money I need.

33:21.050 --> 33:21.760
It's a job.

33:22.690 --> 33:23.870
Two months...

33:26.340 --> 33:27.340
That should work.

33:29.180 --> 33:29.830
I'm in.

33:31.490 --> 33:32.130
Good.

33:32.620 --> 33:33.760
I'll make the arrangements.

33:36.690 --> 33:37.490
Uncle Fu,

33:38.660 --> 33:39.720
I have one more favor.

33:41.140 --> 33:42.900
I've regained my memory,

33:43.182 --> 33:44.680
but could you keep it quiet for now?

33:45.290 --> 33:45.920
Why?

33:46.690 --> 33:47.840
Because right now,

33:49.140 --> 33:50.160
I need to be a patient.

33:54.770 --> 33:56.290
What are you plotting this time?

33:56.860 --> 33:57.490
Alright.

33:58.290 --> 33:59.380
I'll keep your secret.

34:00.860 --> 34:01.800
Thank you, Uncle Fu.

34:04.220 --> 34:12.260
(Jiangnan University,
Teaching Building No. 1)

34:21.170 --> 34:21.840
Dr. Qu.

34:27.630 --> 34:28.560
I owe you an apology.

34:30.720 --> 34:31.940
You've realized

34:31.940 --> 34:33.271
that I had no bad intentions.

34:38.900 --> 34:39.610
I'll get going.

34:39.610 --> 34:40.450
Do you have time?

34:42.080 --> 34:43.340
I'd like to take you to dinner.

34:49.380 --> 34:50.230
I think that works.

35:03.740 --> 35:04.340
Thank you.

35:23.260 --> 35:24.080
Dr. Qu.

35:24.510 --> 35:25.840
Let me formally apologize.

35:26.226 --> 35:27.830
Sorry for questioning your character.

35:29.330 --> 35:29.960
It's alright.

35:30.370 --> 35:31.410
Maybe I do look

35:31.410 --> 35:32.700
like someone up to no good.

35:43.280 --> 35:45.090
I'm not great at jokes.

35:45.330 --> 35:46.160
Neither am I.

35:59.910 --> 36:00.720
May I know

36:01.720 --> 36:03.350
what you said about me to Professor Wu?

36:05.080 --> 36:06.530
Are you always this blunt?

36:06.582 --> 36:09.204
The shortest distance
between two points is a straight line.

36:13.830 --> 36:14.810
You're wondering

36:15.360 --> 36:16.400
if I told Professor Wu

36:16.400 --> 36:17.940
about the family photo

36:17.940 --> 36:19.360
in your book, right?

36:21.240 --> 36:22.530
So you did see it.

36:28.130 --> 36:28.910
Relax.

36:29.220 --> 36:30.550
I didn't say a word to Uncle Wu.

36:34.590 --> 36:35.610
I give you

36:35.610 --> 36:37.130
my word as a doctor.

36:41.170 --> 36:41.920
Thank you.

36:47.100 --> 36:47.730
Let's eat.

36:55.220 --> 36:56.220
Are you free on Saturday?

36:58.420 --> 36:59.210
Why?

36:59.620 --> 37:00.970
I'll leave here Saturday afternoon.

37:01.130 --> 37:02.670
I want to look around in the morning.

37:03.260 --> 37:05.040
But I'm not familiar with the area.

37:05.380 --> 37:07.250
I might get lost and miss my train.

37:15.490 --> 37:16.650
I was hoping

37:17.300 --> 37:18.490
that you could be my guide.

37:19.910 --> 37:20.670
(I heard)

37:20.940 --> 37:22.680
(his father's
a senior military officer,)

37:22.780 --> 37:23.950
(and his mother serves, too.)

37:24.390 --> 37:26.400
(He comes from a top cadre family.)

37:31.130 --> 37:31.620
Alright.

37:43.300 --> 37:47.220
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

37:52.650 --> 37:53.610
Cover him, cover!

37:54.130 --> 37:55.030
Spread out.

37:58.220 --> 37:59.860
How's their training going?

37:59.860 --> 38:00.700
Very motivated.

38:00.900 --> 38:01.540
Next month,

38:01.540 --> 38:03.200
we'll definitely beat Factory No. 9.

38:03.200 --> 38:04.260
Set the screen!

38:04.260 --> 38:05.220
Hold your positions!

38:05.380 --> 38:06.570
Go, Ye Feng!

38:07.270 --> 38:08.110
Nice shot!

38:10.210 --> 38:11.390
Who's that girl?

38:12.130 --> 38:13.180
Does she work here?

38:14.170 --> 38:14.710
No.

38:14.804 --> 38:16.604
From Jiangcheng University, I think.

38:16.750 --> 38:18.900
She's been coming
to watch practice lately.

38:20.320 --> 38:21.780
So she's a college student?

38:26.010 --> 38:27.490
On defense! Spread out!

38:29.050 --> 38:31.520
Ms. Xu, I heard

38:31.820 --> 38:32.940
Ye Feng

38:32.940 --> 38:35.110
might be dating Fei Ni.

38:36.740 --> 38:37.880
Who told you that?

38:39.680 --> 38:40.780
If he were dating,

38:40.780 --> 38:41.770
I'd know about it.

38:43.090 --> 38:44.650
Don't spread rumors.

38:46.860 --> 38:49.000
Ye Feng's a man,
so it wouldn't hurt him.

38:49.640 --> 38:51.770
But you can't damage
a young lady's reputation.

38:52.300 --> 38:53.220
My mistake, Ms. Xu.

38:53.780 --> 38:54.380
I understand.

38:59.120 --> 39:00.780
Go to logistics.

39:02.970 --> 39:04.900
Hand out new towels,

39:04.900 --> 39:06.490
one for each comrade in training.

39:06.490 --> 39:07.030
Got it.

39:07.740 --> 39:08.390
Nice shot!

39:08.610 --> 39:09.400
Alright, keep going!

39:09.970 --> 39:11.490
Move! Stay active!

39:11.610 --> 39:12.640
You two switch!

39:12.640 --> 39:13.650
Cross over!

39:14.150 --> 39:15.090
Go, Ye Feng!

39:17.570 --> 39:18.280
Nice shot!

39:18.450 --> 39:18.940
Alright!

39:20.420 --> 39:21.040
Halftime!

39:21.040 --> 39:21.780
Think it through.

39:21.780 --> 39:22.826
We'll run it again.

39:26.000 --> 39:26.410
Here.

39:27.830 --> 39:28.280
Thanks.

39:29.248 --> 39:30.960
Why have you been coming here so often?

39:31.200 --> 39:32.226
Don't you have classes?

39:32.810 --> 39:34.150
I'm here to watch you train.

39:36.700 --> 39:37.170
By the way,

39:37.440 --> 39:38.880
I wrote an article

39:38.880 --> 39:39.880
about you...

39:40.650 --> 39:41.750
About your team.

39:42.420 --> 39:43.020
Take a look.

39:49.093 --> 39:51.020
(Team Captain Ye Feng
takes a shot during the game.)

39:51.650 --> 39:53.260
That photo makes me look pretty good.

39:54.940 --> 39:55.420
Alright.

39:55.970 --> 39:57.050
I'll keep working hard.

39:57.420 --> 39:57.780
Okay.

39:59.340 --> 40:00.010
Okay,

40:00.220 --> 40:01.390
get back in there.

40:01.390 --> 40:02.420
You've rested enough.

40:02.420 --> 40:03.350
Focus.

40:04.340 --> 40:04.820
Let's go!

40:05.220 --> 40:05.900
Set the screen!

40:14.260 --> 40:14.940
Hello.

40:16.660 --> 40:17.630
May I

40:18.040 --> 40:19.470
take a look at that article?

40:20.110 --> 40:20.900
Of course.

40:30.530 --> 40:31.570
You wrote this?

40:31.570 --> 40:32.000
Yes.

40:33.730 --> 40:34.880
You're...

40:35.700 --> 40:36.710
Ling Yi?

40:38.530 --> 40:39.700
And you are...

40:40.730 --> 40:42.290
I'm Ye Feng's mother.

40:43.440 --> 40:44.160
Hello, Mrs. Ye.

40:45.450 --> 40:46.650
Here at the factory,

40:46.840 --> 40:48.870
they call me Ms. Xu.

40:49.490 --> 40:50.570
Nice to meet you, Ms. Xu.

41:03.820 --> 41:10.340
(Jiangcheng Educated Youth Office)

41:10.680 --> 41:11.440
Fang,

41:12.010 --> 41:15.300
the organization has
approved your medical discharge.

41:15.450 --> 41:18.460
But staying in the hospital long-term

41:18.700 --> 41:19.940
isn't appropriate.

41:19.940 --> 41:20.970
Don't worry, though.

41:21.380 --> 41:22.280
We're already

41:22.293 --> 41:24.160
(Director Gao)
looking into a solution.

41:25.780 --> 41:27.740
Director Gao,
there's no need to deliberate.

41:27.848 --> 41:29.170
I don't have any special requests.

41:29.490 --> 41:30.740
Just a small room will do.

41:31.060 --> 41:32.250
A single-story place is fine.

41:32.420 --> 41:34.250
Near or far, it doesn't matter.

41:40.180 --> 41:40.860
Fang.

41:41.610 --> 41:43.830
I know you're a hero.

41:44.300 --> 41:46.340
It wouldn't be unreasonable
to ask for more.

41:47.220 --> 41:49.680
But we have real constraints.

41:49.900 --> 41:50.830
You see,

41:51.010 --> 41:52.200
you're on your own.

41:52.420 --> 41:53.780
You can make do anywhere.

41:54.010 --> 41:55.050
There are many others

41:55.050 --> 41:56.540
returning with entire families.

41:56.700 --> 41:59.220
Seven or eight people
squeezed into one room.

42:05.380 --> 42:05.970
Wait,

42:06.610 --> 42:07.470
I just remembered.

42:07.570 --> 42:09.870
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory's
new dorms are finished.

42:10.700 --> 42:11.940
Once they move out,

42:11.940 --> 42:13.530
the old dorms will be reassigned

42:13.530 --> 42:15.826
to those without housing
or stuck in temporary housing.

42:15.848 --> 42:18.080
Now, they are assigning the slots.

42:19.010 --> 42:20.660
See, since you were injured

42:20.660 --> 42:22.780
saving one of their employees,

42:22.910 --> 42:23.780
by any standard,

42:23.790 --> 42:25.420
they should allocate you a room.

42:25.820 --> 42:26.970
I'll call Ms. Xu now.

42:28.893 --> 42:30.000
Thank you, Director Gao.

42:37.170 --> 42:37.970
Ms. Xu?

42:38.737 --> 42:40.530
It's Gao from
the Educated Youth Office.

42:41.340 --> 42:43.130
I'd like to discuss something with you.

42:44.970 --> 42:46.010
Director Gao,

42:46.260 --> 42:48.130
you read my mind.

42:49.420 --> 42:51.420
Our Party secretary
personally instructed

42:51.582 --> 42:52.860
that Comrade Fang Muyang,

42:52.860 --> 42:54.780
the one who saved our factory worker,

42:55.220 --> 42:57.610
has made an outstanding
contribution to our factory.

42:58.820 --> 43:00.050
He's always been

43:00.050 --> 43:02.010
on our allocation list.

43:02.780 --> 43:03.520
Of course.

43:05.350 --> 43:07.200
The new dorms are tight on space.

43:07.580 --> 43:09.450
But we can

43:09.450 --> 43:11.700
assign him a room

43:11.700 --> 43:13.440
from the vacated old dormitories.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
